   \text{Normality} = 2 \times \text{Molarity} = 2 \times 6.00 \, \text{M} = 12.0 \, \text{N}
   \]

2. **Calculate the moles of H\(_2\(_4\) in 10.0 L of 2.00 N H\(_2\(_4\):**
   \[
   \text{Moles} = \text{Normality} \times \text{Volume} = 2.00 \, \text{N} \times 10.0 \, \text{L} = 20.0 \, \text{mol}
   \]

3. **Calculate the required normality of the solution after mixing:**
   \[
