5. **Equate the moles of H\(_2\(_4\( in the mixture to the sum of the moles from the two solutions:**
   \[
   \text{Moles from 6.00 M H\(_2\(_4\)} + \text{Moles from 2.00 N H\(_2\(_4\)} = \text{Moles in the final solution}
