   - The bullet has a velocity \(v_{\text{bullet}} = 90.0 \, \text{m/s}\) and a mass \(m_{\text{ball}} = 1 \, \text{kg}\).
   - The Earth has a velocity \(v_{\text{earth}}\) and a mass \(m_{\text{earth}} = 5.97 \times 10^{24} \, \text{kg}\).
   - The total final momentum is:
   \[
   p_{\text{final}} = m_{\text{ball}} v_{\text{bullet}} + m_{\text{earth}} v_{\text{earth}}
   \]

