   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{gas}} = \frac{Q_{\text{gas}}}{T_{\text{gas}}} = \frac{562.775}{1100} = 0.51127 \text{ kJ/K}
   \]

2. **Entropy change of the water (steam vaporization process):**
   The heat required to vaporize 1 kg of water is:
   \[
   Q_{\text{vaporization}} = 1858.5 \text{ kJ/kg}
   \]
